WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.025
Exothermic reactions give out energy; endothermic reactions take it in.

2
00:00:05.975 --> 00:00:10.400
Hydrogen and oxygen react to make water. Watch the temperature.

3
00:00:11.101 --> 00:00:15.226
Each reaction gives out energy, so the particles speed up: hotter.

4
00:00:16.003 --> 00:00:21.228
Energy out is exothermic. Energy in is endothermic, and it gets colder.
